' S-570 / S-431: after DELETE the variable is NULL; reading it is a clean error on every engine, also when
' it is not the first object of the program (MIR used to hand back the stale value / another object's field).
CLASS Box
    PUBLIC
    DIM v AS I32
END CLASS
DIM first AS Box = NEW Box()
first.v = 1
DIM x AS Box = NEW Box()
x.v = 3
DELETE x
PRINT first.v
PRINT x.v
PRINT "unreachable"
